{"title":"뺏어줘서 고마워, 언니 ","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bH6gOm/dJMcabGf2g4/XDMbWhC6UlcKYyE6mptNtK&filename=th3","synopsis":"“미안해, 희서야. 어쩔 수 없었어….”\n\n한희서, 결혼식 한 달 앞두고 파혼당하다.\n다른 사람도 아닌 언니한테 남자를 뺏겨서.\n\n절망으로 시작한 감정이 원망으로 변했지만,\n최후에는 웃을 수 있었다.\n\n“뺏어줘서 고마워, 언니. 진심으로.”\n\n그러지 않았다면 이 남자를 놓쳤을 테니까.\n\n“대표님… 그냥 술친구 해달라면서요?”\n“난 술친구랑 이런 것도 해.”\n\n공적인 사이였을 땐 얼음 같던 남자가, 이렇게 뜨겁게 돌변할 줄 몰랐다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-11-14","rank":130,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-15","rank":130,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-16","rank":178,"change":{"type":"down","amount":48}},{"date":"2026-11-17","rank":131,"change":{"type":"up","amount":47}},{"date":"2026-11-18","rank":246,"change":{"type":"down","amount":115}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-11-14","rank":272,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-15","rank":220,"change":{"type":"up","amount":52}},{"date":"2026-11-16","rank":168,"change":{"type":"up","amount":52}},{"date":"2026-11-17","rank":120,"change":{"type":"up","amount":48}},{"date":"2026-11-18","rank":111,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-11-19","rank":114,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-11-20","rank":127,"change":{"type":"down","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-11-21","rank":180,"change":{"type":"down","amount":53}},{"date":"2026-11-22","rank":217,"change":{"type":"down","amount":37}}],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-11-14","v":1960,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-11-15","v":2597,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-11-16","v":3354,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-11-17","v":3988,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-11-18","v":4274,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-11-19","v":4570,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-11-20","v":4675,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-11-21","v":4736,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-11-22","v":4835,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0}]}